# 33_ego_dissolution_RGB.ledc — Non-Dual Gamma / Ego-Dissolution, RGB inner/outer build (base: 33_ego_dissolution_gamma; name shortened for SPIFFS 32-char limit)
# RGB variant of 33_ego_dissolution_gamma. Audio + speech IDENTICAL (alpha -> 40 Hz gamma
# binaural with beat jitter + harmonic stack -> alpha). The flagship INVISIBLE-FLICKER pair
# maps cleanly to the concentric rings: inner ring warm amber (mask 9, 255,160,32, phase 0)
# + outer ring calm blue (mask 6, 32,96,255, phase 180), 40 Hz, matched dim brightness ->
# mean luminance ~flat while the retina still gets the 40 Hz. Amber<->blue = strongest SSVEP
# pair AND luminance-complementary. 40 Hz above the danger band; DIM <=18%. See base header.
#
# LED: time freq duty bright R G B mask [env phase]   (env 0 = square)

# --- Induction / alpha 10 Hz: antiphase pair + alpha bed fade in ---
0 40 50 >0 255 160 32 9 0 0        # inner amber ring: 40 Hz, phase 0; bright fade-in
0 40 50 >0 32 96 255 6 0 180       # outer blue ring: 40 Hz, phase 180 (antiphase)
A 0 340 0 >0 0 1 350 0             # ch1 alpha binaural: carrier 340 / R350 => 10 Hz beat; vol fade-in
S 3000 default 20 "Settle, and let the breath grow slow. We begin softly at ten hertz."
15000 40 50 18 255 160 32 9 0 0    # inner: 18% dim cap
15000 40 50 18 32 96 255 6 0 180   # outer: 18% (matched -> mean luminance ~steady)
A 60000 340 0 90 0 1 350 0         # ch1 alpha vol settled

# --- Cross-fade into gamma: alpha out, 40 Hz binaural + harmonic in ---
A 120000 340 0 >90 0 1 350 0       # ch1 alpha fades out
A 300000 340 0 0 0 1 350 0         # ch1 alpha off
A 120000 340 0 >0 0 2 380 0 50 4 0 3 1.5:60000   # ch2 GAMMA binaural: 340 / R380 => 40 Hz; beat jitter 1.5 Hz/60 s
A 300000 340 0 80 0 2 380 0 50 4 0 3 1.5:60000   # ch2 gamma vol settled
A 120000 170 0 >0 0 3 210 0        # ch3 HARMONIC octave-down 170/210 => same 40 Hz; fade in
A 300000 170 0 44 0 3 210 0        # ch3 harmonic settled
S 120000 default 20 "Now the field steadies to a gentle forty-hertz shimmer. Let self and surroundings blur at the edges."

# --- GAMMA HOLD: antiphase 40 Hz light + binaural + harmonic, jitter on ---
S 300000 default 20 "Rest in open, boundaryless awareness. Nothing to hold, nowhere to stand. Just this."
S 900000 default 20 "Let the sense of a separate centre soften. Vast, still, undivided — and the light asks nothing of your eyes."

# --- Return: gamma + harmonic fade, alpha returns ---
A 1500000 340 0 >80 0 2 380 0 50 4 0 3 1.5:60000  # gamma vol fades out
A 1620000 340 0 0 0 2 380 0 50 4 0 3 1.5:60000    # gamma off
A 1500000 170 0 >44 0 3 210 0      # harmonic fades out
A 1620000 170 0 0 0 3 210 0        # harmonic off
A 1500000 340 0 >0 0 1 350 0       # ch1 alpha returns: fade in
A 1620000 340 0 70 0 1 350 0       # alpha back at 10 Hz
S 1500000 default 20 "Gently gathering back toward a centre now, carrying the spaciousness with you."

# --- Soft close: alpha + antiphase pair fade to 0 ---
A 1680000 340 0 >70 0 1 350 0      # alpha vol fade
1680000 40 50 >18 255 160 32 9 0 0 # inner: brightness fade
1680000 40 50 >18 32 96 255 6 0 180 # outer
S 1680000 default 20 "Let the shimmer fade. Rest a moment, then open your eyes, whole and clear."
A 1800000 340 0 0 0 1 350 0        # ch1 vol 0
1800000 40 50 0 255 160 32 9 0 0   # inner off
1800000 40 50 0 32 96 255 6 0 180  # outer off

S 1800000 default 20 "WAKE UP!"
S 1810000 default 40 "WAKE UP!"
S 1820000 default 50 "WAKE UP!"
S 1830000 default 60 "WAKE UP!"
